#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4080_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm in a band, you know. We're hoping to get our big break soon."
msgstr "Estoy en una banda, sabes. Espero que pronto tengamos nuestra gran oportunidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4092_Kiryu"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "Vaya."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4104_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Our name is \"The Orpheus.\" There are three other people in the band, but I handle guitar and vocals. I'm kinda in charge."
msgstr "El nombre de la banda es \"The Orpheus\". Somos tres personas en la banda, pero me encargo de la guitarra y cantar. Me siento a cargo de esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4116_Kiryu"
msgid "You're the leader, huh?"
msgstr "Eres la líder, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4128_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yep! We're starting to get some fans, too. More people have been coming to our concerts recently."
msgstr "¡Así es! Estamos consiguiendo algunos fans también. Cada vez viene más gente a los conciertos ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4140_Kiryu"
msgid "It sounds like you're working hard."
msgstr "Ya veo... Parece que estás trabajando duro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4152_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah, but I can't live off of what we make with the band. That's why I'm working here."
msgstr "Sí, pero no puedo vivir con lo que generamos en la banda. Por eso trabajo aquí también."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4164_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "My parents were totally against me being in the band, so I sorta ran away from home and came to Tokyo. I can't go back now."
msgstr "Mis padres rechazaron completamente que estuviera en la banda, así que hui de casa y llegue a Tokyo. No puedo volver a casa ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4176_Kiryu"
msgid "I guess you'll have to make it work then."
msgstr "Supongo que tendrás que hacer que funcione la banda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4188_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Definitely! I want to be a big success and surprise my parents."
msgstr "¡Definitivamente! Quiero ser exitosa y sorprender a mis padres de ello."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=0
msgctxt "4200_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Everybody in the band is super nice. Maybe you can come to a show sometime."
msgstr "Todos en la banda somos muy amables. Si gustas puedes venir a algún show."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4212_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure. That sounds fun."
msgstr "Claro. Suena divertido."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4224_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really!? Thanks! When we make it big, maybe I can hire you as my bodyguard."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4236_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, you've got big plans, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4248_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You bet! Once we're famous, we'll make our overseas debut. But I hear it can be dangerous in foreign countries, so you'll have to protect me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4260_Kiryu"
msgid "Then you better get a move on, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4272_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Don't worry about that! I'm gonna make this work! And I'll take care of you when I do. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4284_Kiryu"
msgid "Being a leader can be hard. You have to make sure the members get along. I hear bands don't last long if the members fall out."
msgstr "Ser una líder es complicado. Tienes que ver que todos los miembros estén de acuerdo. Escuche que hay bandas que no duran mucho tiempo porque sus miembros se pelean."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4296_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Exactly! They also say that you shouldn't date somebody in the same band."
msgstr "¡Así es! También dicen que no debes salir o tener citas con alguien de tu banda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4308_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you a leader in your job too, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¿Eres el líder en tu trabajo también, Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4320_Kiryu"
msgid "I used to be..."
msgstr "Solía serlo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4332_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I thought so. You just seem like the leader type. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Lo sabía! De seguro eres el mejor líder. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4344_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Maybe you can give me some tips."
msgstr "Tal vez puedas darme algunos consejos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4356_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr "Claro."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4368_Kiryu"
msgid "I'd like to hear you play sometime. What kind of music is it, anyway?"
msgstr "Me gustaría escucharte algún día. De todos modos, ¿Qué tipo de música tocan?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4380_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, it's sort of a mix of rock and rap. It might be a bit hard for someone your age to understand."
msgstr "Bueno, es una mezcla entre rock y rap. Puede ser difícil de entender para alguien de tu edad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4392_Kiryu"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Ya veo..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4404_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I could give you a CD, but you really have to come to a gig to truly appreciate our music. It's totally different when we play live!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4416_Kiryu"
msgid "Okay. I'd like to go sometime."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4428_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm sure you'll enjoy it!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4440_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm from Fukuoka Prefecture originally. I was pretty wild back when I was a student."
msgstr "Soy de la Prefectura de Fukuoka. Era una zona peligrosa cuando era estudiante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4452_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Looking back on it now, I can see how stupid I was. But it was fun at the time."
msgstr "Mirándolo bien ahora, que tontita era jejeje. Fue una época divertida en su día."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4464_Kiryu"
msgid "Really? It's a little hard for me to imagine..."
msgstr "¿En serio? Me es complicado verlo así..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4476_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Anyways, I went to my first live concert when I was sixteen. It blew me away!"
msgstr "Igualmente, fui a mi primer concierto en vivo a ¡los seis años! ¡Fue increíble!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4488_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "The band was amazing! I knew then that was what I wanted to do with my life."
msgstr "¡La banda fue increíble! Ahí fue el momento que decidí que quería ser. ♡"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4500_Kiryu"
msgid "So that's what got you interested in music?"
msgstr "¿Así que de ahí viene tus intereses por la música?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4512_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yep. I stopped fighting and doing stupid stuff, and started working part time to earn money. I bought a used guitar and practiced every day."
msgstr "Sep, deje de hacer estupideces, y empecé a trabajar a tiempo parcial para ganar algo. Logre comprar una guitarra usada y practique todos los días."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4524_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I still have that guitar to this day. It's practically falling apart, but I'm pretty attached to it."
msgstr "Todavía tengo la guitarra. Está muy desgastada, pero le tengo mucho cariño."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=1
msgctxt "4536_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I've written a lot of songs with it. It's sort of a part of me and my music."
msgstr "Escribí muchas canciones sobre ella, fue parte de mí y de mi música."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4548_Kiryu"
msgid "Take good care of it."
msgstr "Cuídala bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4560_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, of course! I plan to be buried with it! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Oh, claro que sí! ¡Si me voy, ella viene conmigo! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4572_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, really?"
msgstr "Je, ¿de verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4584_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Do you have anything you love that much?"
msgstr "¿Tienes algo que aprecies mucho, no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4596_Kiryu"
msgid "Hm... I guess I'm still looking."
msgstr "Mm... Creo que todavía lo estoy viendo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4608_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I like the sound of that. It's kinda romantic. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¿Todavía está viendo? Eso suena romántico. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4620_Kiryu"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4632_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Ooh! I just thought of a great line for a song! Thanks! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Oh! ¡Me acabas de dar una gran letra para una canción! ¡Gracias Kiryu-san! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4644_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Je..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4656_Kiryu"
msgid "You want me to buy you a new one? You can't get good sound if it's falling apart."
msgstr "¿No quieres que te compre una guitarra nueva? No tendrás un buen sonido si se llega a romper."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4668_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh? No thanks. I'm happy with the one I have."
msgstr "¿Ah? No gracias. Estoy feliz con la que tengo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4680_Kiryu"
msgid "No need to be modest. To be a good musician you need a good instrument."
msgstr "Para tocar bien necesitas un buen instrumento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4692_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, that's not why I brought it up! Are you trying to bribe me or something!?"
msgstr "¡Ey! ¿Qué estás queriendo insinuar? ¡¿Acaso estás queriendo sobornarme?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4704_Kiryu"
msgid "No, that's not what I meant..."
msgstr "No, no quería decir eso..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4716_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't stand men like that! I didn't think you were that kind of guy!"
msgstr "¡NO! ¡No puedo soportar hombres así! ¡No pensé que fueras así! ¡Atrevido!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4728_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4740_Kiryu"
msgid "I hope you have a big hit someday."
msgstr "Espero que tengas tu gran momento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4752_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah. Maybe I'll even win an award or something one day. Well, it's a nice dream anyways. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Gracias, capaz y gane algún premio o algo, algún día. Sería un bonito recuerdo, ¡cumpliría un sueño! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4764_Kiryu"
msgid "You want it to be more than a dream though, right?"
msgstr "Pero quieres que sea más que un sueño, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4776_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Of course! I'm gonna work as hard as I can to make it come true!"
msgstr "¡Claro! ¡Trabajaré duro para conseguir eso y más! ♥"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4788_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, you could be my escort to the awards ceremony!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4800_Kiryu"
msgid "You sure I'm good enough?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4812_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "As long as you're still a fan when the time comes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4824_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, guess I'll be waiting a while then."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4836_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "My ultimate goal is to go on a world tour with my band."
msgstr "Mi gran objetivo con la banda es hacer una gira mundial."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4848_Kiryu"
msgid "That's a big dream."
msgstr "Es un buen objetivo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4860_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah, but if you're gonna dream, you might as well dream big, right?"
msgstr "Si, pero si tuviera un sueño, podría soñar en mas grande, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4872_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I want to impress people all over the world by singing my songs and playing my guitar."
msgstr "Quiero impresionar al mundo con mis canciones y junto con mi guitarra."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4884_Kiryu"
msgid "Do you sing in English?"
msgstr "¿Sabes cantar en ingles?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=2
msgctxt "4896_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I know some English songs, but your heart is the most important thing. If your songs have heart, they break through any language barrier."
msgstr "Sé algunas canciones en inglés, pero el corazón es lo más importante, si tus canciones las haces con el corazón, rompen cualquier barrera, da igual el idioma."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4908_Kiryu"
msgid "You're right. Great songs can really move you."
msgstr "Tienes razón. Las grandes canciones son las que pueden moverte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4920_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Right! Do you listen to Western music, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¡Eso es! ¿Escuchas música occidental, Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4932_Kiryu"
msgid "No, not really. I don't like it very much actually."
msgstr "No, en verdad, no me gusta mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4944_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Why? Because you don't understand the lyrics?"
msgstr "¿Por qué? ¿No entiendes lo que dicen o por sus letras?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4956_Kiryu"
msgid "No, I just don't like the songs. If they had songs in English that sounded like traditional Japanese ballads, I'd probably listen to them."
msgstr "No, simplemente no me gustan. Si las canciones en inglés sonaran como baladas tradicionales japonesas, posiblemente las escucharía."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4968_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For reals? Hahaha!"
msgstr "¿De verdad? ¡Jajaja!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4980_Kiryu"
msgid "What's so funny?"
msgstr "¿De qué te ríes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4992_Kiryu"
msgid "You're pretty confident, aren't you?"
msgstr "Eres bastante segura, ¿no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5004_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah, I am. I'm proud of my songs."
msgstr "Sep, estoy muy orgullosa de mis canciones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5016_Kiryu"
msgid "That's good."
msgstr "Genial."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5028_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you proud of anything, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¿Kiryu-san, estás orgulloso de algo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5040_Kiryu"
msgid "Yes. My family."
msgstr "Así es, de mi familia."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5052_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Wow. I didn't expect a guy like you to say that."
msgstr "Oh. No pensé que alguien como tú dijera eso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5064_Kiryu"
msgid "Something wrong with that?"
msgstr "¿Hay algo malo con eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5076_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Not at all. I think it's wonderful. I like it when people surprise me like that. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "No, para nada. Me parece maravilloso, me gusta cuando me sorprenden de esa manera. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5088_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, I see."
msgstr "Jeje, ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5100_Kiryu"
msgid "Can I have your autograph? It'll be worth a fortune when you're famous."
msgstr "¿Puedo tener tu autógrafo? Cuando seas famosa valdrá una fortuna."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5112_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha! I've never given anybody my autograph before!"
msgstr "¡Jaja! ¡Nunca le di un autógrafo a alguien antes! ♡"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5124_Kiryu"
msgid "Then I'll be the first."
msgstr "¡Entonces seré el primero!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5136_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I've never really thought about it... Can I do it another day?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5148_Kiryu"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "¿Tú?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5160_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I don't want it to look sloppy. I'm an artist, after all. I want to practice my signature a bit first."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5172_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, all right. I'll look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5184_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you in a relationship now? I'm having zero luck lately."
msgstr "¿Estás en una relación ahora? He tenido cero suerte..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5196_Kiryu"
msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la pregunta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5208_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm just curious. It's been six months since I broke up with my boyfriend. He cheated on me, so I punched him in the face."
msgstr "Por curiosidad. Pasaron ya seis meses desde que rompí con mi novio. Me engaño, así que lo golpee en la cara."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5220_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Where are all the good guys hiding, am I right?"
msgstr "¿Dónde estarán los buenos chicos, no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5232_Kiryu"
msgid "What sort of guy do you like?"
msgstr "¿Qué clase de chicos te gustan, Kyoko?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5244_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well... Forgetting looks for a minute, I like a man with integrity."
msgstr "Bueno... Dejando las apariencias a un lado, me gusta un hombre por su como es."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5256_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "And I can't stand men who cheat or can't see things through."
msgstr "No soporto a los infieles o los hombres con falta de compromiso, vaya que le de igual, eso me enfada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=3
msgctxt "5268_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I haven't been able to find any men like that. What about you? Have you found anybody promising?"
msgstr "Pero no he encontrado a ningún hombre así... ¿Qué hay de ti? ¿Encontraste a alguien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5280_Kiryu"
msgid "I think I may have. Just now."
msgstr "Creo que si, ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5292_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What!? You mean me!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Te refieres a mi?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5304_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5316_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For reals? You're making me blush."
msgstr "¿De verdad? No digas tonterías Kiryu-san, me pondrás roja."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5328_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm serious."
msgstr "De verdad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5340_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You just come right out and say what you think, don't you?"
msgstr "Tú sales y dices lo que piensas, ¿es así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5352_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure. I find them every day."
msgstr "Seguro, las veo todos los días."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5364_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What, you just go from one woman to another?"
msgstr "Como, ¿acaso vas de una mujer a otra?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5376_Kiryu"
msgid "It's not my fault that there are beautiful women everywhere."
msgstr "No es mi culpa que haya mujeres tan lindas en todas partes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5388_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's terrible! I can't stand men who aren't faithful!"
msgstr "¡Eso es terrible! ¡No soporto a los hombres que no son fieles!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5400_Kiryu"
msgid "It's not like I'm having affairs."
msgstr "No es que esté teniendo algo serio con ellas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5412_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But you do check out other women while you're already with one, right? That's unacceptable!"
msgstr "Pero si estás con tu chica y sigues fijándote en otras, ¡eso es repugnante!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5424_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Man, I must have misjudged you, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr "Te juzgué mal todo este tiempo, Kiryu-san..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5436_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5448_Kiryu"
msgid "Not recently."
msgstr "No recientemente."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5460_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No? That's too bad. It must be lonely..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5472_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Or do you have somebody particular in mind?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5484_Kiryu"
msgid "No, it's not that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5496_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5508_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Wait, does that mean you're not attracted to me either?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5520_Kiryu"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5532_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey! Don't play me like that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5544_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Come on! Oh, why can't guys just tell me how they really feel?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5556_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You know, even when I do have a boyfriend, it never seems to last."
msgstr "Sabes, incluso cuando tengo novio, parece que no me dura mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5568_Kiryu"
msgid "Why is that?"
msgstr "¿Y eso por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5580_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I usually end up losing it and punch him."
msgstr "Al final, siempre termino abrumada y le pego."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5592_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They always deserve it, but I regret it a bit sometimes..."
msgstr "Siempre se lo merecen, pero algunas veces me siento mal por eso..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5604_Kiryu"
msgid "You've got a short fuse."
msgstr "Tienes la mecha corta."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5616_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=4
msgctxt "5628_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Should I try to be more gentle and ladylike?"
msgstr "¿Debería tratar de ser más amable y femenina?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5640_Kiryu"
msgid "You shouldn't resort to violence. There must be a better way to solve your problems."
msgstr "No debes recurrir a la violencia. Siempre hay una mejor manera de terminar los problemas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5652_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For sure..."
msgstr "Seguro..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5664_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But you look like I could hit you with my best shot and you wouldn't even feel it."
msgstr "Pero parece que aunque te diera mi mejor golpe, ni siquiera lo sentirías."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5676_Kiryu"
msgid "You might be right."
msgstr "Puede que tengas razón en ello."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5688_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Okay! So all I have to do is find a tough guy like you!"
msgstr "¡Bien! ¡Así que todo lo que tengo que hacer es buscar a alguien como tu Kiryu-san!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5700_Kiryu"
msgid "Well then, how about me?"
msgstr "Bueno, y yo ¿qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5712_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That might not be a bad idea. I'll think about it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "No eres un mal partido Kiryu-san. Lo pensaré. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5724_Kiryu"
msgid "You're not the one who needs to change. They were the ones in the wrong."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5736_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's true. I suppose there's no reason for me to hold back."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5748_Kiryu"
msgid "But maybe you should try to find guys you don't need to hit."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5760_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You're right about that! I have the worst taste in men. They all turn out to be losers."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5772_Kiryu"
msgid "If you went out with me, you'd get a better idea of what a good man is like."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "5784_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha. You're a pretty smooth talker, aren't you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5796_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Je..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5808_Kiryu"
msgid "You have to find a man who's compatible."
msgstr "Tienes que encontrar a un hombre que más compatible."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5820_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But how can you know if somebody's gonna be a good match until you go out with them?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿Cómo sabré si con quien estoy es un buen partido antes de salir con ellos?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5832_Kiryu"
msgid "You have a point."
msgstr "Buen punto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5844_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, how do you tell if a girl is going to be a good match for you?"
msgstr "Y, ¿Cómo sabes que una chica es una buena pareja para ti?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5856_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm not sure. It's just a feeling I get."
msgstr "No lo sé, solo lo siento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5868_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's pretty vague. Can't you do any better than that?"
msgstr "Eso bastante vago. ¿No puedes decirlo de una mejor manera?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5880_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5892_Kiryu"
msgid "You've got guts."
msgstr "Tienes bastantes agallas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5904_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh? Why do you say that?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5916_Kiryu"
msgid "Most women are pretty reserved when they meet me for the first time, but not you."
msgstr "Muchas mujeres son bastante reservas la primera vez que me conocen, pero tu no."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5928_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, people do tell me I'm a little too forward. I've never been easily intimidated."
msgstr "Bueno ya que lo dices, la gente me comenta que voy muy deprisa o muy atrevida. Nunca me he dejado intimidar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5940_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's probably why scary looking customers tend to like me. You know, yakuza guys."
msgstr "Quizás esa es la razón por la que chicos más imponentes les gusto más. Ya sabes, a los yakuzas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5952_Kiryu"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr "Vaya."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=5
msgctxt "5964_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think I amuse them because I can go toe-to-toe with them from the get-go. But... are women really that afraid of you?"
msgstr "Creo que realmente puedo ir paso a paso con ellos y me gustan mas, es como que puedo ir de cara con ellos... Kiryu-san... ¿Es verdad que las mujeres les tienen miedo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5976_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, but kids like me."
msgstr "En parte, a los niños les caigo bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "5988_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Seriously? I would have thought they'd start crying at the sight of you."
msgstr "¿De verdad? Pensaba que correrian de ti al verte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6000_Kiryu"
msgid "Of course not. I'm known as a kind, gentle neighborhood guy back in Okinawa."
msgstr "Claro que no. En Okinawa soy conocido por ser alguien amable y amistoso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6012_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Gimme a break! Everybody's probably too scared of you to tell you the truth!"
msgstr "¡Je, je, je! ¡Probablemente la gente te tenga miedo por decirte la verdad!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6024_Kiryu"
msgid "You..."
msgstr "Aniki..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6036_Kiryu"
msgid "You really think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad crees eso...?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6048_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, are you okay, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¿Estás bien Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6060_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6072_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You're more sensitive than you look. That's so cute. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Eres más blandito de lo que aparentas. Eso es tierno, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6084_Kiryu"
msgid "You don't have to say everything that pops into your head, you know."
msgstr "No tienes por qué decir lo primero que se venga a la mente, ¿sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6096_Kiryu"
msgid "I don't care what people think. I live my life the way I want to."
msgstr "No me importa la gente. Yo vivo como quiero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6108_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah. You don't look like the kind of guy who's concerned about the opinions of others."
msgstr "Claro, no parece que te afecten lo que digan de ti los demás, eso parece."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6120_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm the same way. I do what I think is right, no matter what the people around me say."
msgstr "Pienso igual. Hago lo que me parece correcto, da igual lo que digan las personas que me rodean."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6132_Kiryu"
msgid "Good. You keep that up and your life will be a success. I guarantee it."
msgstr "Muy bien. Sigue así y tu vida será satisfactoria. Lo garantizo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6144_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For reals? I've got the Kiryu-san seal of approval?"
msgstr "¿De verdad? ¿Tengo el sello de aprobación de Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6156_Kiryu"
msgid "You do indeed."
msgstr "Sellado y entregado."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6168_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha. Thanks! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ja, ja, ja. ¡Gracias Kiryu-san! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6180_Kiryu"
msgid "Yes, but my heart is pure."
msgstr "Sí, porque soy puro de corazón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6192_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really? I can't imagine you being like that. In what way is your heart pure?"
msgstr "¿En serio? No puedo imaginarte así. ¿De qué manera eres puro de corazón?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6204_Kiryu"
msgid "Well... I'm pretty sentimental."
msgstr "Bueno... Soy bastante sentimental."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6216_Kiryu"
msgid "Whenever I watch a yakuza movie, I'm in tears by the end."
msgstr "Cada que veo alguna película de Yakuzas, se me escapan las lágrimas al final."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "6228_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm not sure I'd call that pure... And who cries watching yakuza movies, anyway?"
