msgctxt "6288_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hmm... Well, I don't like fancy stuff."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6300_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "When I go to a French restaurant, I get full just by looking at the decor."
