msgctxt "6324_Kiryu"
msgid "I should've known."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6336_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I've always thought it was silly to spend a lot of time on meals. Just eat and get it over with!"
