#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6372_Kiryu"
msgid "It's not strange, but... isn't it bad for your health?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6384_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Nah, it's fine. Hamburgers and pizza both have vegetables on them, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6396_Kiryu"
msgid "But aren't they pretty high in calories?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6408_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Not a problem! I move enough every day to burn them all off. You should see me on stage!"
