#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6576_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Right? So you eat a lot of junk food too, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "6588_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. And on the worst occasions, I get by with just energy drinks."
