#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7716_Kiryu"
msgid "Who were those guys from before, anyway?"
msgstr "Kyoko, en nuestra cita. ¿Quiénes eran los idiotas que nos interrumpieron?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7728_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, they're from Bad Flag. I hear they caused a lot of trouble at clubs in Osaka, and now they're in Kamurocho."
msgstr "Oh, Ellos son Bad Flag. Escuche que causaban un montón de problemas en clubes de Osaka, y ahora están en kamurocho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7740_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They're making things difficult for bands around here now."
msgstr "Le están haciendo la vida difícil a las bandas cercanas o con las que se encuentran ahora."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7752_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They suck."
msgstr "Son unos malditos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7764_Kiryu"
msgid "Is your band okay?"
msgstr "Pero, ¿tu banda está bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7776_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For the moment. But I heard them talking smack about us."
msgstr "Hasta ahora no paso nada. Pero ya me llego que hablan mal de mi banda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=10
msgctxt "7788_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They said I'm just a big tease with my lyrics. Man, I can't stand those guys!"
msgstr "Dijeron que mis letras son un chiste. ¡No los soporto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7800_Kiryu"
msgid "You shouldn't have anything to do with them."
msgstr "No deberías tener que relacionarte con ellos."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7812_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, I didn't start this. But I'll be damned if I'm just gonna sit back and do nothing while they talk smack like that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7824_Kiryu"
msgid "You can never tell what guys like that will do. And avoiding trouble is part of a leader's job, right?"
