#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7848_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm just thinking of what's best for you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7860_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, whatever."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7872_Kiryu"
msgid "You can't let them get the upper hand. Give them an inch and they'll take a mile."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7884_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I know that. Who do you think I am?"
