#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "7920_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, thanks, Kiryu-san. But I'm sure I'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7932_Kiryu"
msgid "You want me to teach them a lesson? We shouldn't wait until something happens."
msgstr "¿Quieres que les dé una visita? Devolverles lo que ellos dan, sería lo mejor antes que algo pase."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7944_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks, I appreciate the thought. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ja, ja, ja, lo agradecería mucho. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7956_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I want to handle this myself. That's how I've always done things."
msgstr "Pero prefiero manejar esto por mí misma. Así siempre hice las cosas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7968_Kiryu"
msgid "Okay. Don't hesitate to call me if you're in trouble."
msgstr "Ok. No dudes llamar si pasa algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7980_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I won't. I'm glad you're on my side, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "No creo hacerlo. Pero me alegro de que estés de mi lado, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "7992_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I just got some good news. Wanna hear?"
msgstr "Tengo buenas noticias. ¿Quieres oírlas?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8004_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure, what is it?"
msgstr "Claro, ¿qué pasa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8016_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I was walking toward Kamurocho Station the other day when this young couple called out to me. I think they were in high school."
msgstr "El otro día estaba caminando hacia la estación de Kamurocho cuando una pareja de jóvenes me llamo. Creo que eran de secundaria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8028_Kiryu"
msgid "And?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Qué más?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8040_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "The two of them met at one of our gigs!"
msgstr "¡La pareja se había conocido en mis conciertos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8052_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "So I'm like cupid to them, basically."
msgstr "Así que me dijeron que soy como su cupido para ellos, básicamente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8064_Kiryu"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8076_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They said they're going to keep coming to our gigs together. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Dijeron también que iban a ir a mis conciertos juntos, qué bonito. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8088_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It sounds silly, but... I felt like I'd made a difference in their lives."
msgstr "Suena un poco tonto, pero... Sentí que hice un clic en sus vidas. ¿Sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=11
msgctxt "8100_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It made me glad I chose to be a musician."
msgstr "Eso me alegra la decisión de dedicarme a la música."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8112_Kiryu"
msgid "Keep working hard for your fans."
msgstr "Sigue trabajando duro para tus fans."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8124_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I will! It's nice to feel needed."
msgstr "¡Lo haré! Se siente bien ser necesitada o tener el apoyo de ellos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8136_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure. But it can sometimes be difficult to live up to people's expectations."
msgstr "Seguramente. Pero eso también puede que ser difícil, tienes que cumplir las expectativas de la gente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8148_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I don't think I have to worry. I've got a perfect ear for music and solid star potential. But you knew that, right?"
msgstr "No creo que me tenga que preocupar. ¡Tengo uno ido perfecto para la música y potencial increíble para ser una estrella! ¿Pero eso me imagino que ya lo sabías, no?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8160_Kiryu"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8172_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, aren't you gonna tell me I should be more modest?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8184_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh, I thought you were being serious..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8196_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha. Even I'm not that full of myself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8208_Kiryu"
msgid "So some of your fans are high school kids?"
msgstr "¿Así que algunos chicos de secundaria son fans?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8220_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah. We have plenty of fans who are in high school."
msgstr "Así es. Tenemos muchos fans que son de secundaria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8232_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Some of my lyrics are about my experiences when I was a teenager, so I guess they can identify with my songs."
msgstr "Algunas de mis letras son de mis experiencias cuando era adolescente, y eso creo que los identifica mis canciones."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8244_Kiryu"
msgid "I see... I hope you're not a bad influence on them."
msgstr "Ya veo... Espero que no sea una mala influencia para ellos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8256_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey! What kind of things do you think I write about?"
msgstr "¡Ey! ¿Qué clase de letras piensas que escribo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8268_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I went through the same things any adolescent kid did. Love, pain, confusion..."
msgstr "Pase por las mismas cosas que un adolescente. Amor, dolor, confusión..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8280_Kiryu"
msgid "So which lyrics are we talking about, exactly?"
msgstr "Entonces... ¿Sobre qué letra estamos hablando, exactamente?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8292_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's a secret. They're too embarrassing."
msgstr "Es un secreto... Me es vergonzoso contarlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8304_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Je..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8316_Kiryu"
msgid "It's ironic to think of you as cupid."
msgstr "Me es irónico pensarte como cupido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8328_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¿Qué me estás queriendo decir, Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8340_Kiryu"
msgid "You brought these kids together when your own love life needs a lot more attention."
msgstr "Reuniste a estos cuando tu vida amorosa necesita más atención."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8352_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Okay, you've got me there. I'm the one who could sure use a cupid."
msgstr "Entiendo... Yo soy la única a la que le vendría bien un cupido."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8364_Kiryu"
msgid "Maybe I could help. I know a lot of guys."
msgstr "Yo podría serlo. Conozco a muchos chicos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8376_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Does that mean you have no interest in me, Kiryu-san? That makes me sad..."
msgstr "¿Me estás diciendo que no tienes interés en mí, Kiryu-san? Qué triste..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8388_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8400_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I've been having writer's block recently. I can't seem to come up with any good songs."
msgstr "He tenido hace poco un bloqueo de escritor. No se me ocurre nada para una canción."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8412_Kiryu"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr "Eso es... una pena."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8424_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It used to come so naturally. The lyrics and melody would just pop into my head."
msgstr "Era algo que me salía natural. Las letras y las melodías solo venían a mi cabeza."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8436_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But now, even playing my guitar doesn't help. I can't come up with anything decent."
msgstr "Pero ahora, incluso tocar la guitarra no me ayuda. No se me ocurre algo decente para tocar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8448_Kiryu"
msgid "That happens sometimes."
msgstr "Eso pasa a veces."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8460_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I'm worried that I'll never be able to write another song."
msgstr "Pero me preocupa no poder escribir ninguna canción nunca más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=12
msgctxt "8472_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Maybe I already used up all my talent..."
msgstr "Tal vez agote todo mi talento..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8484_Kiryu"
msgid "I think you're just too busy. After all, you play in the band and work at the club."
msgstr "Creo que te estás cargando de muchas cosas. Después de todo, tocas en una banda y trabajas aquí en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8496_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You might be right... I haven't been able to relax much these days."
msgstr "Puede que tengas razón... No me tome un día en mucho tiempo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8508_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It's no good if my job at the club gets in the way of my music. Maybe I should quit and work on the band full time."
msgstr "No es bueno que mi camino a ser música sea interrumpida por mi trabajo en el club. Capaz deba dejar el club e ir con la banda a tiempo completo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8520_Kiryu"
msgid "Even if you do that, you shouldn't push yourself too hard. Your brain can't work properly if you don't give it time to rest."
msgstr "Incluso si lo haces, no debes esforzarte demasiado. Tu cerebro debe descansar para andar con todas las energías."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8532_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Right. Thanks for worrying about me. You're so sweet,\\r\n Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Tienes razón. Gracias por preocuparme por mí. Eres muy lindo,\\r\n Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8544_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't mention it."
msgstr "No hace falta."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8556_Kiryu"
msgid "You need a change of pace. You could branch out, try to find things that would get your creative juices flowing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8568_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Come to think of it, I haven't seen a movie in a long time. That could help."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8580_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "And I wouldn't mind taking a stroll through an art museum."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8592_Kiryu"
msgid "We could go together."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8604_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That sounds an awful lot like a date. You can't fool me that easily."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8616_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I appreciate you worrying about me. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8628_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, sure thing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8640_Kiryu"
msgid "Stop complaining. It's not like you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8652_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think I have the right to complain once in a while. I am only human, you know."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8664_Kiryu"
msgid "Yes, but what are the members of your band going to think if you start talking like that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8676_Kiryu"
msgid "A leader has to be strong, or their organization can't function."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8688_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's easy for you to say, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8700_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Look, you're a guy. Maybe that's the way things work for men. But women deal with things differently. You can't expect me to be exactly like you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8712_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8724_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What am I gonna do?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8736_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think a guy has to be able to fight to really be a man, don't you think so?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8748_Kiryu"
msgid "Not necessarily. You have to have heart, too. That's the most important muscle of all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8760_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I know what you mean. There are lots of good fighters who are jerks. But I do think a man has to be able to hold his own, too!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8772_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, but there's really more to it than that..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=13
msgctxt "8784_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You look pretty tough, Kiryu-san. Are you a good fighter?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8796_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm nothing special."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8808_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, come on now. You're just being modest! I bet you've cracked a few heads in your time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8820_Kiryu"
msgid "I don't really keep track of that kind of thing."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8832_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's so cool! A real man doesn't make a big deal about how strong he is. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8844_Kiryu"
msgid "It's really what's on the inside that counts. There's nothing wrong with being able to fight, but knowing when not to fight is far more important."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8856_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh. You're not just some run-of-the-mill thug, are you?\\r\nI think I'm getting to like you more and more. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8868_Kiryu"
msgid "Everybody tries to pick fights with me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8880_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I thought so. What do you do when that happens?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8892_Kiryu"
msgid "I oblige them. I can't just run away. I punish them and I don't stop until they apologize."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8904_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "If you're so strong, couldn't you let them go after a bit? You don't have to beat them to a pulp."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8916_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, they're the ones who picked a fight with me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8928_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you sure you don't just enjoy beating people up? Because that's not true strength."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8940_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I hate people like that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "8952_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8964_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm a pacifist, so I try to avoid fighting. I'd never pick a fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8976_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh. I figured you were the short-tempered type."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "8988_Kiryu"
msgid "I only fight as a last resort. If I can solve a problem by talking it out, that's what I do."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9000_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, so your pacifism is like a code of honor for you. That's pretty cool. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9012_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9024_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I was thinking the other day when I was alone, and I realized something kinda shocking."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9036_Kiryu"
msgid "Shocking?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9048_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah. I may have a submissive streak. I always thought of myself as the opposite, so I was pretty surprised!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9060_Kiryu"
msgid "Uh... How are you submissive?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9072_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I was daydreaming about what my ideal kiss might be like."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9084_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You know, what kind of man, what sort of situation, and so on."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9096_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9108_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, are you okay? You look a little uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9120_Kiryu"
msgid "It's, uh, nothing..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9132_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Okay. Anyway, I found myself wanting a man to make the first move and steal a kiss from me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=14
msgctxt "9144_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Isn't that submissive?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9156_Kiryu"
msgid "No. You're not submissive. Not when you fight your boyfriends so easily."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9168_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "¿De verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9180_Kiryu"
msgid "You probably want a man who's tough like you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9192_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I hadn't considered that. Maybe I'm attracted to men who are stronger than me. Somebody forceful that could dominate me..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9204_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think you'd fit the bill, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9216_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh. I'm not that forceful of a man."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9228_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha. Then I'll just have to become the kind of woman you'd want to dominate. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9240_Kiryu"
msgid "You're submissive all right."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9252_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I thought so."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9264_Kiryu"
msgid "Maybe you just want men to order you around."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9276_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But... if somebody weaker than me tried to do that, it'd just make me mad. Maybe if it was somebody I liked..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9288_Kiryu"
msgid "Hmm. That's interesting."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9300_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Don't go getting any weird ideas. You're not planning on ordering me around, are you? I think you'd regret it!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9312_Kiryu"
msgid "I wasn't planning anything of the kind."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9324_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I dunno... Maybe I shouldn't have mentioned it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9336_Kiryu"
msgid "That seems pretty normal, actually. Everybody has a little bit of that in their personality."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9348_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You think so?"
msgstr "¿De verdad lo cree?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9360_Kiryu"
msgid "I mean, if you have to know definitively yes or no, I'd say you're not submissive. Not by a long shot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9372_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You don't have to try so hard to convince me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9384_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I feel a little better. There's nothing wrong with me, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9396_Kiryu"
msgid "Right. But if you want somebody to forcefully steal a kiss from you, I could arrange something."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9408_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha! Maybe later. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9420_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9432_Kiryu"
msgid "What's wrong? You seem distant."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9444_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry. I'm just a little worried."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9456_Kiryu"
msgid "About what?"
msgstr "¿De qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9468_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I had a fight with the guys in my band."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9480_Kiryu"
msgid "Ah."
msgstr "Ah."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9492_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "We get together twice a week to practice, and yesterday I brought my new song."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9504_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It was a ballad. We've never done one of those before."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9516_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, ballads don't really fit your image."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9528_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What can I say? I like to try new things."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9540_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But the guys said they didn't want to change the band's direction. They refused to play my song."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=15
msgctxt "9552_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It really pissed me off. I ended up leaving in the middle of practice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9564_Kiryu"
msgid "You should sit down and talk this out. Make sure you're all on the same page for the band's future."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9576_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I'm the one who's writing the songs. Shouldn't they play what I want?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9588_Kiryu"
msgid "Not really. You need the other members as much as they need you, so you should try compromising a bit."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9600_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think you're right..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9612_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "All right then. I'll listen to what they have to say. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> Whew! I was worried the band would break up!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9624_Kiryu"
msgid "Glad I could help."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9636_Kiryu"
msgid "You were wrong. You should apologize."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9648_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What!? Why should I apologize!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9660_Kiryu"
msgid "Once an organization loses faith in its leader, it's over. If you let them play the kind of songs they want, it might smooth things over."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9672_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But then they won't play my song."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9684_Kiryu"
msgid "Sometimes a leader has to make sacrifices."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9696_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I don't like the sound of that. A leader has to be strong and decide what the group will do, even if they don't like it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9708_Kiryu"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Mmm..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9720_Kiryu"
msgid "You'll make up sooner or later. Why don't you wait for things to cool off?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9732_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I dunno. We've had arguments before, but this one seems like it's not going to just go away."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9744_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "And it's like I'm the bad guy this time, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9756_Kiryu"
msgid "Wait a minute. You want to apologize, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9768_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9780_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9792_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I suppose so. I hate fighting like this. But won't that make me look weak?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9804_Kiryu"
msgid "You and your ego."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9816_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "All right. I'll apologize if you think I should."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9828_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Ugh. But what should I say...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9840_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "My friend and I were out drinking the other day, and one of those roadside fortune tellers called out to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9852_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Oh..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9864_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I didn't want to do it, but my friend insisted on having her palm read, and somehow I ended up having mine done too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9876_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "And do you know what she said when she looked at my palm?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9888_Kiryu"
msgid "No. What did she say?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9900_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "\"You will never be successful unless you change your lifestyle!\""
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9912_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It really pissed me off. I got into a huge argument with the woman!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9924_Kiryu"
msgid "That's too bad."
msgstr "Eso es... una pena."

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=16
msgctxt "9936_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Do you believe in fortunetelling?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9948_Kiryu"
msgid "I check my horoscope every day. I can't live without it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9960_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh!? You really believe in fortunetelling? For reals?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9972_Kiryu"
msgid "I do whatever I can to get good luck. I figure it can't hurt, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "9984_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But that kind of thing is wrong pretty often, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "9996_Kiryu"
msgid "That's true..."
msgstr "Eso es verdad..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10008_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Then what's the point? It doesn't even give you a sense of security."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10020_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm pretty surprised. I thought you'd say you didn't believe in that kind of crap, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10032_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10044_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, sort of. But not those guys you see on the street."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10056_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "So what kind of fortunetelling do you believe in?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10068_Kiryu"
msgid "The fortunes in magazines are pretty good."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10080_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Is that right? Do you know what your fortune for today is?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10092_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. It said I would meet the girl of my dreams."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10104_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh? You don't think it was talking about me, do you? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10116_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh. Could be."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10128_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hmm... Maybe there is something to this fortunetelling stuff after all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10140_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm usually the one telling people's fortunes. Want me to read your palm?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10152_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, stop it. Weren't you listening when I said I don't like fortune tellers?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10164_Kiryu"
msgid "A lot of my fortunes come true, you know."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10176_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "A lot? Then some of them don't come true, right?\\r\nThat's just guessing then!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10188_Kiryu"
msgid "Look, you don't have to take my word for it. Just let me try it on you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10200_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's enough! It's obvious you're just looking for an excuse to touch my hands!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10212_Kiryu"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr "Lo siento..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10224_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You know, I dress up nice for work, but when I'm off the clock I prefer casual streetwear."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10236_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I pretty much only wear jeans. You won't catch me in a skirt outside the club."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10248_Kiryu"
msgid "There's nothing wrong with that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10260_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I don't know. Sometimes I think about changing my image."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10272_Kiryu"
msgid "What kind of change were you thinking of?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=17
msgctxt "10284_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Maybe going for an all leather look? Like leather pants and a leather jacket."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10296_Kiryu"
msgid "Sounds like you'd look like a musician."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10308_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I <Italic>am</Italic> a musician! So, do you think it'd look good on me?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10320_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, sounds like a real rock-n'-roll vibe to me. Should be perfect for you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10332_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really!? Maybe I'll go shopping then!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10344_Kiryu"
msgid "You'll have to show it to me sometime."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10356_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hehe. Come to one of our concerts and you can see it. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10368_Kiryu"
msgid "You're quite a promoter..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10380_Kiryu"
msgid "That's not really much different, is it? Why don't you try wearing a skirt instead?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10392_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh? You like girly stuff like that, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10404_Kiryu"
msgid "Not really, but if you're going to change your image, you might as well make it a big change."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10416_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you the kind of guy who doesn't notice when a girl changes her hairstyle?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10428_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10440_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Lots of guys are bad about that. They never notice little changes. Makes me wonder what they're really paying attention to..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10452_Kiryu"
msgid "But you can't expect a guy to notice a tiny change like that. You have to change something major."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10464_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No! Guys should pay more attention to how girls look!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10476_Kiryu"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr "Si tú lo dices..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10488_Kiryu"
msgid "I can't really say without seeing it first."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10500_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I can't exactly show up for work dressed like that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10512_Kiryu"
msgid "Who says it has to be here? I'd like to see how you dress when you're off work."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10524_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you trying to invite me on a date? That's kind of cute. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10536_Kiryu"
msgid "So? How about it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10548_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'll think about it. I might be able to show you once I get to know you a little better. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10560_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll look forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10572_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Can I tell you something?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10584_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure, what is it?"
msgstr "Claro, ¿qué pasa?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10596_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Are you okay with scary stories?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10608_Kiryu"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr "No se preocupe."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10620_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well... there was a ghost in my apartment."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10632_Kiryu"
msgid "A ghost?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10644_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yeah. I went home after work yesterday and went to bed... Then I suddenly woke up."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10656_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It felt like my whole body was wrapped in chains. I couldn't move at all!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10668_Kiryu"
msgid "Uh-huh..."
msgstr "Uh-huh..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10680_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I couldn't even breathe. And just when I was about to panic..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10692_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "The curtains started to flutter!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10704_Kiryu"
msgid "And?"
msgstr "¿Y? ¿Qué más?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10716_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "And... that's it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10728_Kiryu"
msgid "That's it?"
msgstr "¿Solo eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=18
msgctxt "10740_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Yep. After a little bit I could move again, so that's when I screamed. Pretty scary, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10752_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, that's scary."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10764_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, you look a little pale. Are you sure you're not afraid of ghosts?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "10776_Kiryu"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "Claro que no."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10788_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "A big strong guy like you, afraid of ghosts! That's hilarious!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10800_Kiryu"
msgid "I told you I'm not afraid! Let's just talk about something else, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10812_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha. Well, I know an even scarier story I can tell you!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10824_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh, great."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10836_Kiryu"
msgid "That's got nothing to do with ghosts. It was just the wind blowing your curtains."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10848_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Nope. The window was closed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10860_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, maybe you had the air conditioning on..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10872_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No, that room is definitely haunted! Do you know anything about exorcisms?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10884_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh, come on."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10896_Kiryu"
msgid "First off, there's a scientific explanation called sleep paralysis. And sometimes people just confuse dreams with reality."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10908_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "What? Are you saying I was dreaming the whole thing!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10920_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, yeah."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10932_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I should never have brought this up. I thought you had an open mind."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10944_Kiryu"
msgid "I think my mind is pretty open..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10956_Kiryu"
msgid "Maybe I should sleep with you next time. If any ghosts show up, I'll take care of them."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10968_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha! You'd be worse than the ghosts. I probably wouldn't sleep a wink for worrying about what you might do to me. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10980_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, I'm not as bad as a ghost."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "10992_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Sorry. I'm not gonna fall for that one. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11004_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Besides, if I got up in the middle of the night to go to the bathroom and ran into you, I'm sure I'd have a heart attack."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11016_Kiryu"
msgid "How rude..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11028_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For some reason, people around me think of me as some kind of big sister."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11040_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They talk to me about their problems and ask me for advice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11052_Kiryu"
msgid "What's wrong with that?"
msgstr "¿Qué hay de malo con eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11064_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I don't really mind, but the other day I met a high school boy after a concert."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11076_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr "Oh..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11088_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "He walked right up to me and said, \"Please make me your apprentice!\""
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11100_Kiryu"
msgid "Attracting apprentices, are you? That's pretty impressive."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=19
msgctxt "11112_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I keep telling him that I'm not interested in training any apprentices, but he won't listen."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11124_Kiryu"
msgid "You can't do it half-heartedly. It won't be good for you or your apprentice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11136_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I thought so. Do you have an apprentice, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11148_Kiryu"
msgid "Sort of. He was like a younger brother to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11160_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can totally picture that! Did he follow you around and call you Aniki or something? <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11172_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, that's all in the past now..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11184_Kiryu"
msgid "The point is that unless you truly intend to look after this kid, you should keep saying no."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11196_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I think you're right. I'll tell him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11208_Kiryu"
msgid "What's wrong? Don't you think you can do it? Why not give it a try?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11220_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No, it's not that... I just think I haven't done anything that'd be worth teaching to somebody."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11232_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm the one who should be the apprentice to somebody else."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11244_Kiryu"
msgid "What kind of attitude is that? You can't expect to make it big without any followers."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11256_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But I hate people who try to make themselves look more important than everybody else. My friends in the band are my equals."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11268_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I guess you'd never understand that, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11280_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11292_Kiryu"
msgid "Just ignore him. The kid'll give up sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11304_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11316_Kiryu"
msgid "Besides, you don't need apprentices to teach people. They say a man teaches the most by the example he sets."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11328_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, you don't have to be a guy to do that!\\r\nBut, I think I get what you mean."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11340_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I guess I just have to live a life that will be inspiring to kids like him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11352_Kiryu"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "11364_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks! I'll tell him that he can't be my apprentice, but if he wants to learn from my actions, I won't stop him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11376_Kiryu"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Perfecto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11388_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "So, um, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr "Emm..., Kiryu-san..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11400_Kiryu"
msgid "Why the long face?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la cara larga?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11412_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "The bassist in my band was attacked by someone last night."
msgstr "El bajista de mi banda fue atacado por alguien anoche."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11424_Kiryu"
msgid "What? Who did it?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?! ¿Quien fue?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11436_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No idea... He was walking alone when somebody hit him from behind."
msgstr "Ni idea... Él estaba caminando solo, cuando alguien le pego por atrás."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11448_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Luckily he wasn't seriously injured. Just knocked out."
msgstr "Por suerte no le paso nada de gravedad. Lo noquearon eso sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11460_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But when I think about what could have happened... It makes me mad!"
msgstr "Pero cuando pienso en lo que le podría haber pasado... ¡Me llena de rabia te juro!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11472_Kiryu"
msgid "Does he have any idea who it might've been?"
msgstr "¿Tienes alguna idea de quién le habrá hecho eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11484_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No. He's a great guy. I can't believe anybody would wanna hurt him."
msgstr "Ni idea. Él es un chico bueno. No puedo creer que alguien le haya pegado así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11496_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "But... those guys from Bad Flag do seem to be jealous of our band's popularity."
msgstr "Pero... Los chicos de Bad Flag parecen estar celosos de lo populares que somos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11508_Kiryu"
msgid "Those guys from before. Yeah, I wouldn't put it past them."
msgstr "Son los tipos de antes... Ya, no te dejarán la oportunidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=20
msgctxt "11520_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't stand those guys!"
msgstr "¡Son insoportables estos sinvergüenzas!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11532_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't do anything hasty. And don't think about getting revenge."
msgstr "No lo hagas sin pensarlo. Y ni pienses en vengarte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11544_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "So I'm supposed to just sit back while they attack my friends!?"
msgstr "¡¿Así que dices que deje que ataquen a mis amigos?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11556_Kiryu"
msgid "You'd just be doing them a favor. If they get the police involved in this, you won't be in a position to play in your band, will you?"
msgstr "Kyoko, solo estarías haciéndoles el favor. Si lo haces y va la policía, no podrías tocar en tu banda o ¿me equivoco?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11568_Kiryu"
msgid "It would disappoint your fans, too."
msgstr "Y además decepcionarías a tus fans..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11580_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's true... I couldn't take it if it resulted in the band splitting up."
msgstr "Es verdad... Tiene sentido, y al final la banda se separaría..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11592_Kiryu"
msgid "Just sit tight until we find out for sure who was behind this."
msgstr "Siéntate hasta que descubramos con certeza quién está detrás de esto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11604_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You're right. I was just so upset, I didn't think about my fans..."
msgstr "Tienes razón. Estaba tan cegada, no pensé en las consecuencias..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11616_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> I'll tell the other band members to stay outta trouble, too."
msgstr "Gracias, Kiryu- san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> Les dire a los miembros de la banda que no se metan en esto también."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11628_Kiryu"
msgid "Good, that's for the best."
msgstr "Bien, es lo mejor para ustedes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11640_Kiryu"
msgid "You should watch out. They might come after you next."
msgstr "Deberías tener más cuidado. Capaz seas la siguiente a la que quieran ir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11652_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They can all bring it on! I'll make them sorry for hurting my friend!"
msgstr "¡Pues pueden intentarlo! ¡Se arrepentirán de haber lastimado a mi amigo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11664_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't underestimate them. Even you'd have trouble facing several men by yourself."
msgstr "No los subestimes. Además, ¿Que harás si son demasiados? No podrías sola."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11676_Kiryu"
msgid "For now, just try to avoid doing anything alone. Maybe I should be your bodyguard."
msgstr "Por ahora, no hagas ni trates de hacer eso por sola. Tal vez debería ir contigo como un guardaespaldas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11688_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks. But you don't need to go out of your way for me like that."
msgstr "Gracias Kiryu-san. Pero no hace falta que te esfuerces por mí así."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11700_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'll hang around with the other guys in the band. Thanks for the offer, though."
msgstr "Me quedaré con otros chicos de la banda. Gracias por ofrecerte igualmente."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11712_Kiryu"
msgid "I see... Well, call me if anything else happens."
msgstr "Ya veo... Bueno, llámame si pasa algo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11724_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I will!"
msgstr "¡Lo prometo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11736_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll get revenge for you. Just tell me where to find them."
msgstr "Me vengaré por ti. Solo dime donde y les parto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11748_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey! What're you talking about!?"
msgstr "¡Ey! ¡¿De qué estás hablando?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11760_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll teach them a lesson they won't soon forget. Don't worry, I'm used to this kind of thing."
msgstr "Les daré una lección que no olvidaran. No te preocupes, estoy acostumbrado a estas cosas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11772_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No, that's okay. You don't have to do anything, Kiryu-san."
msgstr "No, está bien. No tiene que hacer nada, Kiryu-san."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11784_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh? Aren't you angry about what they did?"
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿No estabas enojada por lo que hicieron?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11796_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Of course I am! You'd just escalate the situation, though. This is our problem."
msgstr "¡Claro que lo estoy! Solo que escalaría el problema, solo eso. Este es nuestro problema. (NT:Está sacando a Kiryu del tema.)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11808_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "If you do something without telling me, I'll never forgive you!"
msgstr "Si haces algo sin decirme, ¡no te lo perdonaré!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11820_Kiryu"
msgid "Okay..."
msgstr "Bueno..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11832_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Did you know there's gonna be a battle of the bands event in Kamurocho?"
msgstr "¿Sabes que habrá una batalla de bandas en Kamurocho?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11844_Kiryu"
msgid "No..."
msgstr "No..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11856_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "They said the winner gets a record deal!"
msgstr "¡Dicen que el ganador se llevara un contrato discográfico!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11868_Kiryu"
msgid "You're entering, right?"
msgstr "¡¿Entraste?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11880_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Of course! I heard other famous indie bands are entering too, but we'll beat 'em!"
msgstr "¡Claro! Escuche también, que entraron otras bandas indies muy famosas, ¡Pero los venceré!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11892_Kiryu"
msgid "You're pretty confident."
msgstr "Estás muy confiada."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=21
msgctxt "11904_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Sure am! We're the best band in the city! You gotta come and see us!"
msgstr "¡Claro que lo estoy! ¡Somos la mejor banda de la ciudad! ¡Tienes que venir a vernos!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11916_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure. I'll be there. Make sure you do your best."
msgstr "Lo estaré. Haz tu mejor esfuerzo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11928_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> This'll be the first time you've actually seen my band, huh?"
msgstr "¡Gracias! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> Sera la primera vez que veas mi banda, ¿eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11940_Kiryu"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11952_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, but..."
msgstr "Oh, pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11964_Kiryu"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11976_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I'm happy you're coming, but your clothes..."
msgstr "Estoy contenta que vayas, pero tu ropa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "11988_Kiryu"
msgid "No good, huh?"
msgstr "No está a la moda..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12000_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Our fans are mostly younger. A lot of high school kids. You'd stick out like a sore thumb."
msgstr "La mayoría de nuestros fans son jóvenes. Son chicos de secundaria. Sobresaldrías mucho."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12012_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, it probably doesn't matter. Just having you there will help me relax."
msgstr "Bueno, Seguramente no importe. Con tenerte por ahí me ayudará a relajarme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12024_Kiryu"
msgid "Good."
msgstr "Perfecto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12036_Kiryu"
msgid "If I can make it."
msgstr "Si puedo, voy."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12048_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh... Right. Sure, if you're free..."
msgstr "Oh... Cierto. Claro, si estás libre..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12060_Kiryu"
msgid "Sorry. I'm not always free to play around whenever I want."
msgstr "Perdón. No siempre estoy con tiempo para jugar cuando quiero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12072_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Play around!? It sounds like this doesn't mean a thing to you."
msgstr "¡¿Jugar?! Parece que no te importa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12084_Kiryu"
msgid "I didn't mean it like that. It's just that I'm a pretty busy guy..."
msgstr "No quería decirlo de esa manera. Solo que algunas veces estoy muy ocupado..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12096_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Sorry for interrupting your busy schedule! Don't worry about trying to make it!"
msgstr "¡Perdón por malgastar tu OCUPADO tiempo! ¡No te preocupes en ir!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12108_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12120_Kiryu"
msgid "Maybe I could sing a song..."
msgstr "Tal vez podría ir a cantar..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12132_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh!? You want to sing, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr "¡¿Eh?! ¿Quieres cantar, Kiryu-san?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12144_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure. You don't get the chance to sing a song on stage every day."
msgstr "Claro. No siempre se tiene la oportunidad de cantar en un escenario."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12156_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, this isn't karaoke! Don't be ridiculous!"
msgstr "¡Ey, esto no es un karaoke! ¡No seas tonto!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12168_Kiryu"
msgid "I'll take that as a no..."
msgstr "Lo tomaré como un no..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12180_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, maybe you and I could form a band ourselves. Then you could sing to your heart's content."
msgstr "Ey, si te parece, tú y yo podríamos formar una banda, y así podrías cantar lo que tengas contenido en tu corazón."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12192_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh, that's an interesting idea."
msgstr "Je, eso es a una idea interesante."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12204_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Kiryu-san, what would you do if my band won the contest?"
msgstr "Kiryu-san, ¿Qué harías si mi banda gana el concurso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12216_Kiryu"
msgid "Well... I suppose I'd be surprised."
msgstr "Bueno... Supongo que me alegraría."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12228_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Is that it? Anything else?"
msgstr "¿Solo eso? ¿Nada más?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12240_Kiryu"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr "¿Cómo qué?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12252_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, you could get a present or two for me, in honor of my dream coming true and all."
msgstr "Bueno, podrías prepararme un regalito o dos, en honor a mi gran sueño haciéndose realidad por fin."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=22
msgctxt "12264_Kiryu"
msgid "A present, huh? Hmm..."
msgstr "Un regalo, ¿eh? Mm..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12276_Kiryu"
msgid "How about going out for a nice meal?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal una gran cena en celebracion?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12288_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really!? Anything I want?"
msgstr "¡¿De verdad?! ¿Puedo pedir cualquier cosa?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12300_Kiryu"
msgid "Sure, anything. What do you feel like?"
msgstr "Claro, cualquier cosa. ¿Qué te parece?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12312_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well... I want a huge Chinese feast!"
msgstr "Bueno... ¡Quiero un gran festín de comida china!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12324_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "You know, where they keep bringing dish after dish after dish until you're like, \"I can't eat any more!\" I've always wanted to try that! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "Ya sabes, El lugar donde siguen trayendo plato tras plato tras plato hasta que no des más, ¡Siempre he querido ir allí! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12336_Kiryu"
msgid "That sounds expensive..."
msgstr "Suena caro... (yo y mi gran bocota)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12348_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I saw it on TV. I think they said it was roughly 3 million yen if you go to China."
msgstr "Lo vi en la TV. Creo que dijeron que ronda los 3 millones de yenes si es en China."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12360_Kiryu"
msgid "3 million!? Um..."
msgstr "¡¿3 Millones?! Eeeh..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12372_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, don't look so worried! I was just kidding!"
msgstr "Oh, ¡no te preocupes Kiryu-san! ¡Estaba bromeando!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12384_Kiryu"
msgid "Whew..."
msgstr "Uf..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12396_Kiryu"
msgid "I could take you on a trip somewhere. Is there someplace you want to go?"
msgstr "Podría llevarte de viaje. ¿Hay algún lugar que quieras ir?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12408_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "For reals!? I don't know, that's a big question..."
msgstr "¡¿De verdad?! N-No sé, nunca lo pensé..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12420_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I know! I wanna go to Waiha!"
msgstr "¡Ya sé! ¡Quiero ir a Waiha!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12432_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh? You mean Hawaii? Why do kids think it's cool to say everything backwards these days? Hawaii doesn't seem quite your style, though."
msgstr "¿Eh? ¿Quisiste decir Hawái? ¿Por qué los jóvenes de ahora dicen todo el revés? Aunque... Hawái no parece ser muy de tu estilo ¿Estas segura?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12444_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I've just been so busy, a trip to Waiha might help me relax."
msgstr "Estuve muy ocupada durante mucho tiempo, un viajesito a Waiha podría despejarme."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12456_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Besides, all the stars go to Waiha on their vacations. And I've never been to Waiha, so..."
msgstr "Además, muchos famosos vacacionan en Waiha. Y nunca he conocido Waiha..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12468_Kiryu"
msgid "You just wanted an excuse to say Waiha, didn't you?"
msgstr "Solo buscas una excusa para ir a Waiha, ¿no es así?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12480_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Haha! You got me! But I really would like to go to Hawaii!"
msgstr "¡Ja, ja, ja! ¡Me tienes! ¡Pero de verdad me gustaría conocer Hawái!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12492_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Thanks for offering to take me! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr "¡Gracias por ofrecerme llevarme! Lo aprecio mucho Kiryu-san. <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12504_Kiryu"
msgid "Me and my big mouth..."
msgstr "Yo y mi bocota..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12516_Kiryu"
msgid "You want money?"
msgstr "¿Quieres dinero?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12528_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "That's not what I meant! I want something special, something to remind me of the occasion."
msgstr "¡No me refería a eso! Quiero algo especial por mi día especial, algo para el recuerdo, ¿sabes?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12540_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, you can do a lot of things with money."
msgstr "Bueno, en ese caso, puedes hacer muchas cosas con el dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12552_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No, I want something that shows me how you feel. Something from your heart!"
msgstr "No... Quiero algo que muestre algo de ti. ¡Algo desde el fondo de tu corazón!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12564_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It's hardly thoughtful if you just toss me some money and tell me to buy something, isn't it!?"
msgstr "No es lindo que solo me tires el dinero y me dices que compre algo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12576_Kiryu"
msgid "Well... Kids seem to like it..."
msgstr "Bueno... a los niños veo que les gusta..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12588_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Oh, am I a kid now? You're just too lazy to think of something!"
msgstr "¡Oh! ¿Ahora soy una niña? ¡Eres un idiota Kiryu Kazuma!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12600_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Now I'm depressed..."
msgstr "Que triste que seas así..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12612_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12624_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Hey, Kiryu-san. Can we talk about something serious?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12636_Kiryu"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "¿Qué cosa?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12648_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It may sound strange hearing this from me, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12660_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12672_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't seem to stop thinking about you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12684_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "It doesn't matter if I'm talking with another customer or rehearsing with the band."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12696_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't get you out of my head lately."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12708_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
#. y4:msg_role=decision
#. y4:msg_decision_role=prompt
#. y4:msg_decision_group=23
msgctxt "12720_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I... I may be falling in love with you..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12732_Kiryu"
msgid "Me too. I've been feeling that way about you for a while now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12744_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Really!? You mean we both feel the same way?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12756_Kiryu"
msgid "Looks like it."
msgstr "Así parece..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12768_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't believe it! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default> What now? We start dating?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12780_Kiryu"
msgid "We should wait until that competition of yours is over."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12792_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Right. I've really gotta give that my all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12804_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "I can't wait for it now. I'd better get in some more practice! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12816_Kiryu"
msgid "Don't get too excited. Relax and be yourself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12828_Kiryu"
msgid "You'd be a fool to fall in love with me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12840_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Well, I guess that makes me a fool, because I'm falling for you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12852_Kiryu"
msgid "I like that about you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12864_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean? Do you like me, too?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12876_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. Is there something wrong with that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12888_望月京子：源氏名"
msgid "No! Not at all! I'm ecstatic to hear that! <Color:7>♥<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "12900_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh..."
msgstr "Je..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "12912_Kiryu"
